# ☀️ Suryabandhu

### Smart IoT-Based Load Monitoring and Dynamic Solar Energy Allocation System for Multi-Flat Residential Buildings

Suryabandhu is a prototype system designed to demonstrate **shared rooftop solar energy monitoring, household load monitoring, solar energy allocation, fair-split billing, savings estimation, and fault detection** for multi-flat residential buildings.

The project combines a **web-based monitoring dashboard** with an **Arduino-based hardware prototype** to represent how a shared solar-energy system can be monitored and managed at the household level.

Simulation LINK__-- https://www.tinkercad.com/things/fckQXyhZyI5-iot-based-load-monitoring-amp-solar-energy-allocation-system?sharecode=jD-KeIXDOLeE7DkDjxXSzLGUAMWJ72Q0PpV8WV6USQQ
